{"speciesId":491,"names":{"fr":"Darkrai","es":"Darkrai","en":"Darkrai","ja":"ダークライ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Folklore has it that on moonless nights, this Pokémon will make people see horrific nightmares."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Menacé, ce Pokémon se protège en créant des cauchemars dans l’esprit de ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Menacé, ce Pokémon se protège en créant des cauchemars dans l’esprit de ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il endort humains et Pokémon, et leur fait avoir des cauchemars pour les chasser de son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Defiende su territorio de personas y Pokémon haciéndoles dormir y provocándoles pesadillas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"深い 眠りに 誘う 力で 人や ポケモンに 悪夢を 見せて 自分の 縄張りから 追い出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a la capacité de bercer les gens pour les faire rêver. Il se montre durant les nuits de nouvelle lune."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Puede adormecer a la gente y hacerles soñar. Está activo en las noches de luna nueva."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"人々を 深い 眠りに 誘い 夢を 見せる 能力を 持つ。 新月の 夜に 活動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il endort humains et Pokémon, et leur fait avoir des cauchemars pour les chasser de son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Defiende su territorio de personas y Pokémon haciéndoles dormir y provocándoles pesadillas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"深い 眠りに 誘う 力で 人や ポケモンに 悪夢を 見せて 自分の 縄張りから 追い出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il a la capacité de bercer les gens pour les faire rêver. Il se montre durant les nuits de nouvelle lune."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Puede adormecer a la gente y hacerles soñar. Está activo en las noches de luna nueva."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"人々を 深い 眠りに 誘い 夢を 見せる 能力を 持つ。 新月の 夜に 活動する。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"On a moonless night, a strange incident occurred in which every one of a village's inhabitants suffered nightmares. The villagers attested that Darkrai appeared before them in these nightmares."}],"varieties":[{"id":491,"m